e a ciel sereno. Persino lo specchio sembra impietoso con le sue rughe. E come se non bastassero questa catena di tragedie, l'adorata moglie fa una scoperta sorprendente. Anche loro due, i nonni, stanno per avere un bambino..."},{"id":35061,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":3046,"locale":"it","key":"release_date","value":"1995-12-08"},{"id":35060,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":3046,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"il-padre-della-sposa-2"},{"id":22389,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":3046,"locale":"it","key":"views","value":"21641"}],"keywords":[{"id":325,"name":"daughter","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:15.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:15.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":325}},{"id":531,"name":"aging","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:51:18.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:51:18.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":531}},{"id":801,"name":"parent child relationship","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:52:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:52:42.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":801}},{"id":1555,"name":"pregnancy","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:56:18.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:56:18.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":1555}},{"id":3521,"name":"baby","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:09:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:09:00.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":3521}},{"id":4637,"name":"confidence","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:22:58.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":4637}},{"id":5451,"name":"midlife crisis","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:33:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:33:03.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":5451}},{"id":6150,"name":"contraception","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:42:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:42:26.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":3046,"keyword_id":6150}},{"id":6151,"name":"gynecologist","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:42:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:42:2